      "typical_award_size": "Revolving predevelopment loan fund for affordable housing in the Coachella Valley. The County contributed $2,000,000 of District 4 ARPA funds on May 24, 2022 and added $1,500,000 to Lift to Rise in the FY 2026-27 budget (approved June 9, 2026); Lift to Rise's action plan targets 10,000 affordable homes in ten years with more than 50 regional partners.",
